      "text": "ADAPTATION:\n  Piezophilic enzymes: more flexible backbone structures\n  Amino acid substitutions: bulky residues (Ile) → smaller (Val, Gly)\n  Reduced steric hindrance → active site maintains geometry under pressure\n  Example: Lactate dehydrogenase (LDH) from *Coryphaenoides armatus*\n    (abyssal grenadier fish) functions optimally at 400+ atm"
